{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And the angel of Elohim journeyed.</b> It is he who leads the pillar of cloud, and therefore 'and the pillar of cloud journeyed.' <b>The angel of Elohim</b> — this is as it says, 'YHWH went before them,' and since he is the emissary of HaShem, Scripture calls him YHWH. Another interpretation: <b>and an angel journeyed</b> — Scripture left its words unspecified at the outset, not informing who the angel going before them was, and afterward explained that it is the pillar of cloud, and the darkness was between Israel and Egypt, as it goes on to explain."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:47.592514684Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}